#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD9710 expect=skipped domain=SUPPAE
# Rule:Description: PMDA-SD9710 — the Required key QNAM is not populated.
#note "QNAM is absent from SUPPAE, so Requirements.Variables.All gates the rule to SKIPPED rather than firing on every row. This is the absent-column guard the standing 'absent column = all-missing column' policy makes necessary: without it empty(QNAM) would be true on every row of every dataset that simply lacks the column. Asserts the SKIP, not merely the absence of a finding."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset SUPPAE
col STUDYID type=Char
col RDOMAIN type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col IDVAR type=Char
col IDVARVAL type=Char
col QLABEL type=Char
col QVAL type=Char
---
S1      | AE      | S1-001  | AESEQ | 1        | Other Medically Important SAE | Y
---
